<title>GERMANY: MAN H1 96/97 gp net profit 80 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>MAN H1 96/97 gp net profit 80 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half results for 1996/97 through December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   80	vs 110</p>
<p>    Group sales				  8,805   vs 8,668</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    11,000  vs up 9 pct</p>
<p>    MAN Roland unit sales		  888     vs 1,010</p>
<p>    Nutzfarzeuge sales		     3,631   vs 3,818</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German truck maker and engineering group is MAN AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
